cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Maryland Hospital Global Budget Revenue Dataset
message: If you use this dataset, please cite it.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Ahmadi
    given-names: Farzin
    affiliation: Towson University
    email: fahmadi@towson.edu
version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-08-19
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A tidy, versioned, machine-readable compilation of Maryland Health Services
  Cost Review Commission (HSCRC) public reports on the state's all-payer
  hospital global budget system. Covers hospital revenue and volume by month,
  rate center, setting, payer and patient residency for FY2017-FY2026;
  statewide and hospital-level financial condition for FY2005-FY2024,
  extracted from PDF; a hospital identity crosswalk linking HSCRC hospital
  numbers to CMS Certification Numbers and every name variant observed; and a
  sourced reference table of Maryland hospital rate center codes.
keywords:
  - Maryland
  - global budget revenue
  - all-payer model
  - hospital finance
  - health policy
  - HSCRC
  - AHEAD model
